# Re-include the lockfile the repo-wide rule ignores; pin deps for deterministic CI.
# (Root .gitignore miscategorizes package-lock.json under generated files; the harness
# binary is already covered by root `*.exe`, so no local rule is needed for it.)
!package-lock.json
